-- comments
1:1 plain -- A `--` comment at column 1 inside a tag or a hole is a comment and not a
2:1 plain -- declaration: comments are not tokens, so the column-1 rule that ends
3:1 plain -- markup does not fire on one (frontend.md §9.1). The tokens and the tree
4:1 plain -- show the tag and the hole going on after the comment, to their ends.
